@startuml 01-deployment
!include ../_style.iuml
title Deployment (current state)

node "Static host\n(nosnocabo.pages.dev)" as pages {
  artifact "dist/ (vite build)" as dist
  artifact "mockServiceWorker.js" as swjs
  artifact "unicornStudio/*.json" as unicornJson
}

node "Browser" as browser {
  component "React SPA" as spa
  component "MSW worker" as msw <<mocked>>
}

node "Docker host (docker-compose.yml)" as host {
  node "web (python:3.10-slim)" as web <<issue>> {
    component "Flask app.py\napp.run(debug=True) :3000" as flask
  }
  node "db (postgres:15)" as dbnode {
    database "webring\nvolume db_data" as db
  }
}

pages --> browser : HTTPS
spa --> flask : HTTP API_URL\n(VITE_DEV_API_URL,\ndefault localhost:3000)
spa ..> msw : ENABLE_MOCKS
flask --> db : postgres:5432
web ..> dbnode : depends_on\n(service_healthy)

note right of web
  Production gaps:
  • Flask dev server with debug=True (no gunicorn)
  • FLASK_ENV=development, source bind-mounted
  • Postgres creds hardcoded (compose + alembic.ini)
  • API_USER / API_PASS set but unused
  • IS_BETA=1 → the webring-link check is skipped
  • CORS(app) allows every origin
  • Schema = db.create_all() at boot; Alembic
    only covers url_* tables
  • No CI, no tests
end note

@enduml
